&lt;h2&gt;Find SSH config hosts by IP&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search SSH config aliases by host name, IP address, or user.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search by IP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type part of a host name or IP address, or a user name, to find the alias that connects there.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Host names in the list&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each alias shows the host it connects to, resolved the same way OpenSSH resolves it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.12"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
